COMMENT ON COLUMN valve_state.injection_locked IS '加注阀锁定状态：TRUE锁定须双人复开';
COMMENT ON COLUMN valve_state.alarm_active IS '浓度连续越限告警状态';
COMMENT ON COLUMN valve_state.breach_count IS '当前连续越限检测次数，合格即归零，达2锁阀';
